
# Netflix Top 10 Viewership Analysis

**Tools:** Python, pandas, Matplotlib

## Overview

This project explores Netflix Top 10 viewing patterns, focusing on how long titles remain popular rather than relying solely on their initial performance.

## Objective

Examine whether a title's longevity in the Top 10 provides additional insight into audience engagement beyond its launch-week performance.

## Data

Netflix Top 10 viewing records covering titles, rankings, countries, and reporting periods.

## Methodology

- Prepared and examined Netflix viewing records.
- Explored viewing patterns across titles and countries.
- Evaluated the length of time titles remained in the Top 10.
- Developed six visualizations to communicate patterns in viewing performance.

## Key Findings

A title's initial performance does not necessarily capture its long-term popularity. Examining how long titles remain in the Top 10 provides another perspective on viewing patterns.

## Practical Application

Longevity-based analysis can help inform content performance assessments and provide additional context when comparing the popularity of different titles.

